        <h1>Collaborate</h1>

        <p>
            Busted Tusk is built around collaboration.
        </p>

        <p>
            We create relics from natural materials that carry character,
            history, and meaning. As the caravan grows, we are looking for
            artists and craftspeople whose work shares that philosophy.
        </p>

        <p>
            Woodworkers. Metalsmiths. Stoneworkers. Rockhounds.
            Carvers. Jewelers. Artists working in bone, antler, shell,
            mineral, or other natural materials.
        </p>

        <p>
            We are interested in the material itself—not simply what can be
            made from it. Its origin, character, history, and imperfections
            are part of the work.
        </p>

        <p>
            If you have a material, a craft, or an idea that you think belongs
            with Busted Tusk, we would like to hear from you.
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>Tell us what you make, what materials you work with,
            and what you would like to create together.</strong>
        </p>

        <p>
            <a href="mailto:bustedtusk@gmail.com">bustedtusk@gmail.com</a>
        </p>

    </section>

